  "description": "Once a member of a powerful gang, Gu Tae-Won is now broke, homeless, and on the run. With nowhere left to turn, he finds himself on the edge—literally—contemplating his life atop a bridge. Just when things seem hopeless, a well-dressed stranger approaches with a surprising offer:\n\n*“You need some money, right? I can help you.”*\n\nTae-Won doesn’t refuse the offer to spend one night together with this strange man…but can he trust the hand that’s pulling him back from the brink?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n *Note: Includes three side story chapters.*",
